WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.345
Right this way guys.

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.187
You live in mainland China.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:21.980
Yes. Okay.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.274
Do you bring anything from China
to the United States?

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.234
No. You have a good day.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.528
Thank you. How are you doing?

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:28.903
Good.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:32.115
What's the purpose of your trip?

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.493
What did you do?

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:40.457
Just hang out the weekend.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:43.543
I just wait over there for him.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.880
I noticed that he was very blunt,
and I asked him, why didn't he go

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.050
to the Dominican Republic,
which is a source country for narcotics?

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:53.178
And he just quickly said,
I just wanted to have fun.

00:00:53.511 --> 00:00:56.806
So I want to talk more to him
and engage more in a conversation with.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:01.478
He’s got two bags. We’ll get them.

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.523
These both yours? Yep.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:08.318
All right.

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:11.529
Follow us way.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.619
We got a lot of questions for you.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:19.996
First of all, are all these
your bags in front of you?

00:01:21.372 --> 00:01:23.374
When did you pack your bags?

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:28.588
All right.
You packed them by yourself.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:29.255
All right.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.132
Anybody give you anything to bring over?

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.432
A step back.

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:43.228
So why did you go to the Dominican
Republic?

00:01:52.028 --> 00:01:53.571
How many days? 

00:01:57.826 --> 00:01:58.868
A lot of stuff to take

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.162
for just four days or so.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:04.541
Why all the cookware.

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:05.708
You bought this down there?

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:16.928
So your mom gave this to you
in Santo Domingo?

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.349
Oh, she gave it to your friend. Okay.

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:28.523
Something spilled.

00:02:29.524 --> 00:02:31.151
Onion shampoo

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:33.945
that for you?

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.497
Do you use this shampoo?

00:02:48.084 --> 00:02:48.793
Not too many people

00:02:48.793 --> 00:02:51.421
come back with two bottles of shampoo
when they go on a four day trip.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:56.426
It's a good concealment method for a lot
of narcotics and shampoo bottles.

00:02:59.095 --> 00:03:02.056
They figure we're not going to get
our hands dirty and do a thorough check.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.809
And get the Gemini
for me. We'll do a test on.

